# Semantic index exclusions. Git exclusions still apply separately; this file
# removes generated, duplicated, or low-signal text from VaultSpec RAG.

# Generated provider copies of the canonical VaultSpec rule/skill surfaces.
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
.gemini/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md

# Generated documentation surfaces. Keep hand-written docs/ pages indexable.
docs/_build/
docs/cli/
docs/api/

# Raw BOE normatives HTML: the article-split preprocessor emits clean
# per-article *.extracted.md sidecars for these, which rank far better than
# the raw markup (the raw HTML polluted the low-score tail with TOC link
# farms and tag noise). Exclude only the raw .html here so the clean
# *.extracted.md sidecars remain the sole index entry for this corpus. The
# pattern matches *.html but not *.html.extracted.md (different suffix), and
# is scoped to normatives/html so other raw HTML without a sidecar stays
# indexable.
src/aeat/_data/corpus/normatives/html/*.html

